    "The dataset contains 100,000 ratings from 943 users for 1,682 movies. All ratings are integers between 1 and 5. No missing field values or duplicate user–movie pairs were found, so no rows were removed. Unrated user–movie combinations are absent from the table and will appear as missing entries when constructing the rating matrix."
